Hi Daniel,

This works for me. The problem is that you cannot run new versions of unmarked on old versions of R. See http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/unmarked/index.html. So if you update R and then update unmarked, it will work. To see what version of unmarked you have, type:

packageVersion("unmarked")

Best,
Richard

